#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = czyste krawynżnie w srogości renderu gry. DLSS = to samo, a przi Skalowaniu gry pod 100 % "
"ôbraz przi tym roztōnga. wył. = ôbrŏz samyj gry: do porōwnań. Zapisuje sie richtik."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Gotowe sztelunki dlŏ Twojij karty. wysoki = wszysko włōnczōne (model 1). srzedni = model 2, "
"półwielki szpyr przezrŏczistości, płŏski szpigle bez ruchu tajli, lżyjsze szukanie ruchu tajli. "
"niski = tyż bez DLAA szpigli, bez szpyru przezrŏczistości, ôbszar VR 60 %. Nigdy niy zmiynia "
"tego, co sam ustawiōł."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = nojwiyncyj szczegółōw, nojostrzyjszy tekst, kole 1,6x GPU modelu 2. 2 (E) = wyrōwnany, "
"nojmyni smug za ruchym: zacznij tukej. 3 (F) = nojspokojniejszy na płotach i drutach, może "
"rozmazować ruchowe szczegóły, kosztuje tela co 2. 4 (M) = nojcięższy (kole 5x), yno do testōw w "
"trybie płŏskim."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Jakość ôbrazu: ôstrzynie, ôstrość tekstur, ôbszar DLAA i szpyr przezrŏczistości. Prawo ôtwiyra "
"grupa, Lewo jã zawiyrŏ; przi kożdym ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Ôstrzi ôbrŏz po DLAA, ôd 0 (wył.) do 1,0. Zwiynksz, jak ôbrŏz je miynki; za wiela dŏwŏ jasne "
"ôkrōngi na krawynżniach. Kosztuje kole 0,1 ms; 0 pomijŏ tyn przebiyg."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Jak daleko sięgŏ ôstrzynie, ôd 1 do 4 px: małe = drobne szczegóły, wielge = grubsze krawynżnie. "
"Zmiyń, jak ôstrzynie je za drobne abo za grube; ôbrŏz wiynkszy ôd ekranu, jak we VR, potrzebuje "
"wiyncyj niż 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Ôstrzyjszy tekst na teksturach (znaki, deska, GPS). 0 = wył.; barzyj ujymne = ôstrzyj, ale "
"wiyncyj migotanio na płotach; sprōbuj -0,5 do -1, jak tekst je rozmazany. Bez kosztu GPU, yno "
"trocha przepustowości pamiyńci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"To samo dlŏ siatek, trŏwy i listowio: zwiynksz ku 0, jak płoty migocõ, zmyńsz, jak trŏwa je "
"miynko. tak samo = jak wiersz wyżyj. Robi yno, jak Ôstrość tekstur niy je 0. Bez kosztu GPU, "
"trocha pamiyńci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: yno srodek kożdego ôka dostŏwŏ DLAA (20 do 100 %); brzeg zostŏwŏ ôbrŏz gry. Zmyńsz, żeby "
"uciōng cięższy model abo mieć wiyncyj klatek; 40 % kosztuje kole 40 % modelu. Sztelowuje tyż fůra "
"w garażu / menu głōwnym."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Yno płŏski: DLAA przed bloomym / tonemappingym gry, tōż farby na drógach, drŏty i szyny migocõ "
"myni. Zmiyń yno do porōwnań. Niy robi z DLSS skalowaniym ani Windows HDR. Taki sam koszt; "
"przełōnczanie trwŏ kole 60 klatek."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Dŏwŏ drŏtōm, płotōm i szkłu włŏsnõ ôdległość zamiast tyj z tła, tōż sie niy rozmazujõ w ruchu. "
"Wyłōncz, jak tam niy widzisz smug: ôszczyndzŏ 0,02 - 0,06 ms na ôko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Niy pozwŏlŏ, żeby blask lamp i świateł aut ciōngnōł smugã za sobõ w ruchu: DLSS bierze kożdy "
"blask z terŏźnyj klatki, niy z historyji. Kroki ôd 25 %; zmyńsz, jak blaski migocõ, 0 = wył. "
"Kosztuje kole 0,05 - 0,2 ms na ôko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Jak DLAA traktuje ruchowe tajle i szpigle fůry. Prawo ôtwiyra grupa, Lewo jã zawiyrŏ; przi kożdym "
"ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Dŏwŏ kożdyj ruchowyj tajli (ruch, koła, tablice) włŏsny ruch dlŏ DLAA, tōż je ôstro i bez smug. "
"Wyłōncz yno coby ôszczyndzić kole 0,5 ms na ôko abo do testōw: potym kożdy piksel sie ruszŏ z "
"kamerõ, a ruch sie rozmazuje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Dŏwŏ szpiglōm fůry włŏsne DLAA, coby niy migotały. 1 szpigel = yno nojwiynkszy (głōwny kole "
"ciebie). wszyske = kożdy szpigel. kamera = nojtaniej na szpigel, ruch może zostŏwiać smugi w "
"szkle; inaczyj kożdŏ tajla ruszŏ sie richtik w szkle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"włōn. = kożdy szpigel dostŏwŏ DLAA co drugõ klatka i miyndzy tym pokazuje ostatni czysty ôbrŏz: "
"kole pōłowa kosztu szpigli. Krawynżnie czyste; ruchowe rzeczy w szkle ôdświyżajõ sie we pōł "
"tempa. wył. = kożdy szpigel w kożdyj klatce."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Cienkie drŏty trzimiõ ruch, jak jedziesz: DLAA rozkłŏdŏ dane ruchu na cienkie linie (dylatacyjŏ "
"ruchu DLSS). włōn. = domyślnie. wył. = yno do porōwnań; blisko drŏty migocõ barzyj. Ôbrŏz na "
"chwila miynknie przi zmianie."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Cienkie drŏty dostŏwajõ szpyr na kożdym pikselu, kerego sie tykajõ, niy yno tam, kaj kryjõ srodek "
"piksela. włōn. = domyślnie. włōn. (bez A2C) = tyż dlŏ przezrŏczistych krawynżni. wył. = yno do "
"porōwnań; blisko drŏty migocõ barzyj."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Ekspyrymyntalne: rysuje daleke drŏty cieńsze niż 1 piksel jako linia 1 piksela, coby sie niy "
"rwały na kreski. Domyślnie wył.: daleke drŏty mogõ być ciymniejsze abo barzyj migotać. Sprōbuj i "
"porōwnej."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Skalowanie DLSS, przełōncznik DLAA włōn. / wył. i informacyje ô OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Prawo "
"ôtwiyra grupa, Lewo jã zawiyrŏ; przi kożdym ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS rysuje ôbrŏz nazŏd do pełnyj srogości, jak Skalowanie gry je pod 100 %: ôstrzyj niż włŏsne "
"rozciōnganie gry, a myni pikseli to wiyncyj fps. Bez dodatkowego kosztu; nic niy robi przi "
"Skalowaniu 100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Włōnczŏ abo wyłōnczŏ cały mod i pamiyntŏ tryb; wył. pokazuje ôbrŏz samyj gry, do porōwnań. Wył. "
"ôszczyndzŏ koszt wszyskich tajli naroz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generowanie klatek VR ôd djules75, ôsobne pobranie "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). znaleziōne = jego warstwa je załadowano we tyj grze, a mod "
"przepuszcza jij robota. Włōncz jego aplikacyjõ w zasôbniku przed grõ."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = zestŏw ulepszyń OpenXR ôd DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, szpyr, "
"generowanie klatek; znaleziōne = jego warstwa je załadowano we grze, a mod przepuszcza jij "
"robota. Używej yno jednego Turbo (jego abo moda)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Przispieszynia VR: Turbo, renderowanie foveated i maska skrytego ôbszaru. Prawo ôtwiyra grupa, "
"Lewo jã zawiyrŏ; przi kożdym ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: bez ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojekcyje. Yno VR. włōn. = gra niy czeko na gogle w "
"kożdyj klatce: wiyncyj fps yno jak limitym je CPU (zatłoczone miasta, ruch). Wyłōncz, jak ôbrŏz "
"szarpie. Z OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Ôstry srodek, myni szczegółōw na brzegu (yno NVIDIA RTX). Ôszczyndzŏ GPU przi wysokim Skalowaniu. "
"Yno VR. Zewnyntrzny piyrsciyń je cieniowany roz na 2 x 2 piksele; płoty, trŏwa i listowie majõ "
"pełne szczegóły. Wyłōncz, jak brzeg wyglōndŏ blokowo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Jak wielge je ôstry srodek Foveated (VRS), 10 - 100 % co 5 %: wiynkszy = wiyncyj ôstrego widoku, "
"myni ôszczyndzaniŏ; myńszy = wiyncyj ôszczyndzaniŏ, niższy szczegół zaczyna sie blyżyj srodka. 80 "
"% (wyrōwnany) je domyślne; 90 = szeroki, 65 = wōski."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Na kere przebiegi gry robi Foveated (VRS). scyna = yno świat 3D (domyślnie). scyna + ôświetlynie "
"= tyż przebiyg ôświetlyniŏ gry, yno na samym brzegu: wiyncyj ôszczyndzaniŏ. Przetestuj: szukej "
"blokowych krawynżni świateł abo cieni z boku widoku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Jak grube je zewnyntrzne piyrsciyń Foveated (VRS). Normalny = 1 farba na 2 x 2 piksele "
"(domyślnie). Mocny = na 4 x 2, Maks. = na 4 x 4: wiyncyj ôszczyndzaniŏ GPU, barzyj blokowe "
"krawynżnie. Nojlepij z eye trackingym, kaj niy patrzisz na zewnyntrzne piyrsciyń."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Ekspyrymyntalne. Ôstry srodek Foveated (VRS) idzie za ôczami w goglach z eye trackingym "
"(spojrzynie OpenXR, np. Varjo); bez niego zostŏwŏ na srodku soczewki. Potrzebuje włōnczōnego "
"Foveated (VRS) przi sztarcie gry, inaczyj restart. Prawie bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR. Gra pomijŏ rogi soczewek, kerych niy widać (gogle jich zgłŏszajõ), tōż rysuje myni "
"pikseli: wiyncyj zapasu GPU, widziany ôbrŏz bez zmian. Piyrsze włōnczynie potrzebuje restartu "
"gry. Wyłōncz, jak brzeg widoku wyglōndŏ źle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Limity klatek i CPU: NVIDIA Reflex i limit FPS dlŏ trybu płŏskiego, limit FPS VR, sztelowanie "
"CPU. Prawo ôtwiyra grupa, Lewo jã zawiyrŏ; przi kożdym ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Yno tryb płŏski, yno NVIDIA. włōn. = klatki gry krōcij czekajõ w kolejce GPU: myńsze ôpōźnienie "
"wejścia, jak limitym je GPU. Boost trzimie tyż wysoke zygary GPU. Te same fps; małe koszta. Niy "
"robi we VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Yno tryb płŏski. Trzimie grã nojwyżyj na tyj liczbie klatek: stały czas klatki, myni cepła i "
"prōndu. Sztelnij trocha pod tym, co PC trzimie w ruchliwym mieście. Przi włōnczōnym Reflex "
"limituje sterownik NVIDIA. wył. = bez limitu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR. połowa = gra rysuje co 2. klatka gogli (72 Hz -> 36 fps), trzecia = co 3.; reprojekcyjŏ "
"gogli (ASW / Motion Smoothing) wypełniŏ resztã we stałym rytmie. Użyj, jak fps sie hupiõ. Na czas "
"robiynia wyłōnczŏ Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Trzi przełōncznikie CPU naroz: wōntek głōwny i renderujōncy wolõ rdzynie P (yno hybrydowe CPU "
"Intela), gra robi z priorytetym Wyżyj normalnego, a Windows niy może jij dławić (EcoQoS) ani "
"ignorować jij żōdań zygara. Pomŏgŏ, jak limitym je CPU; bez kosztu. Ôsobne sztelunki w dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Pozycyjŏ, srogość, szpyr i kierunek panelu a klawisze menu. Prawo ôtwiyra grupa, Lewo jã zawiyrŏ; "
"przi kożdym ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR. Za głowõ = panel ruszŏ sie z goglami. Stały w kabinie = zostŏwŏ na jednym placu przed "
"fotelym, stabilny, jak sie rozglōndŏsz; X / Y / szpyr sztelujõ tyn plac (stopnie, metry). "
"Potrzebuje warstwy VR (domyślnie). Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Przesuwŏ panel na boki, w % ekranu (VR stały w kabinie: stopnie wkoło fotela). Płŏski i VR majõ "
"ôsobne pozycyje. Użyj, jak panel zasłŏnia cosik potrzebnego. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Przesuwŏ panel w gōra / w dōł, w % ekranu (VR stały w kabinie: stopnie, plus = w dōł). Płŏski i "
"VR majõ ôsobne pozycyje. Użyj, jak panel zasłŏnia cosik potrzebnego. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Zwiynkszŏ abo zmyńszŏ panel. Zwiynksz, jak niy idzie go przeczytać, zmyńsz, jak zasłŏnia za "
"wiela. Płŏski i VR majõ ôsobne srogości. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR, tōż we trybie płŏskim zeszarzone. Jak daleko unosi sie panel: w metrach (0,30 - 3,00) "
"jako warstwa VR, domyślnie; w px przesuniyńcia do srodka na ôko przi menu_vr_layer = 0. Ta sama "
"srogość na kożdym szpyrze. Zmiyń, jak patrzynie na panel mynczy. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR, tōż we trybie płŏskim zeszarzone. włōn. = panel ôbraca sie do ciebie, jak go przesuniesz "
"na bok, ta sama srogość pod kożdym kōntym (jako warstwa VR, domyślnie, tyż pole fps idōnce za "
"głowõ); wył. = płŏski ôbrŏz. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Małe pole z fps i czasym klatki na żywo, tyż jak menu je zawarte (płŏski i VR). Użyj, coby "
"widzieć, co dŏwŏ sztelunek. Jego koszt GPU je mierzōny: na klatka, kożdy ôbrŏz, w kerym je "
"rysowane; zero po wyłōnczyniu. Zapisz zachowuje je do nastympnego sztartu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zamek, pozycyjŏ, srogość, farba, ôdległość VR i ôbrōt pola fps. Prawo ôtwiyra grupa, Lewo jã "
"zawiyrŏ; przi kożdym ôtwarciu menu je zawarto."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR. Za głowõ = ruszŏ sie z goglami. Stały w przestrzyni gry = jedyn plac wkoło fotela, "
"ignoruje kołysanie kabiny. Przymocowany do pojazdu = przilepiōny do kabiny, kołysze sie z nią "
"(potrzebuje DLAA + wektorōw ruchu tajli). Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, yno Przymocowany do pojazdu. włōn. = kożdŏ fůra / auto ma włŏsny plac pola fps w kabinie, "
"ôbrōt, srogość, farba, jasność i tekst (zapisane w dlaa.ini przi zawarciu menu). wył. = jedyn "
"wspōlny zestŏw dlŏ wszyskich pojazdōw. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, yno Przymocowany do pojazdu. Prawo = zmierz kabina jeszcze roz teraz (siedź spokojnie, na "
"postoju), jak pole stoji źle. Lewo = pole tego pojazdu nazŏd do domyślnych (plac, ôbrōt, srogość, "
"farba, tekst); inksze pojazdy zachowujõ swoje. Pole je prostopadłe do kabiny."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Przesuwŏ pole fps na boki, w % ekranu (VR stały / przymocowany: stopnie wkoło ciebie). Płŏski i "
"VR majõ ôsobne pozycyje. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Przesuwŏ pole fps w gōra / w dōł, w % ekranu (VR stały / przymocowany: stopnie, minus = w gōra). "
"Płŏski i VR majõ ôsobne pozycyje. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR, tōż we trybie płŏskim zeszarzone. Ôbraca pole fps w lewo / w prawo wkoło swojij ôsi, w "
"stopniach (+ = jego przōd skryncŏ w prawo). Użyj, coby ustawić pole pod kōntym, jak je z boku. 0 "
"= patrzi na ciebie. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR, tōż we trybie płŏskim zeszarzone. Przechylŏ pole fps, w stopniach (+ = jego wiyrch "
"ôdchylŏ sie ôd ciebie, jakby leżało na desce). 0 = patrzi na ciebie. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR, tōż we trybie płŏskim zeszarzone. Ôbraca pole fps we jego płaszczyźnie, w stopniach (+ = "
"po zygarze). 0 = prosto. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Zwiynkszŏ abo zmyńszŏ pole fps (0,2 .. 3,0). Zwiynksz, jak niy idzie go przeczytać w goglach abo "
"na wielgim ekranie. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Farba tekstu pola fps: 20 farb, kożdŏ z ôbwōdkõ, coby szło przeczytać na kożdym ôbrazie (czorny "
"na biołym = ciymny tekst, biołŏ ôbwōdka). Płŏski i VR. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jasność pola fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = farba bez zmian, niżyj przyciymnia tekst (ôbwōdka zostŏwŏ) ku "
"czerni. Użyj, coby przyciymnić licznik w nocy abo w goglach. Płŏski i VR. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jak przezrŏczyste je cołkie pole fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = pełne, niżyj blednie tekst I jego czorno "
"ôbwōdka naroz, tōż przyciymniōne pole niy robi sie czorny plama. Płŏski i VR. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Yno VR, tōż we trybie płŏskim zeszarzone. Jak daleko unosi sie pole fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Zachowuje "
"tã samã srogość w widoku na kożdyj ôdległości; zmiynia sie yno szpyr. Sztelnij blisko szpyru, na "
"kery patrzisz, coby czytać bez zmiany ôstrości. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Co idzie do dlaa_inject.log: wył. = nic; błyndy = yno awaryje (domyślnie); ostrzeżynia = + "
"ôbejścia problemōw; info = + sztart i zmiany; debug = + statystyki, a debug włōnczŏ tyż timery "
"GPU i profiler CPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gŏdka tego menu. auto = gŏdka gry (domyślnie); Lewo / Prawo wybiyrŏ inkszõ. Linux / Proton: "
"chińskŏ, japōńskŏ i koreańskŏ potrzebujõ zainstalowanych czcionek, glej README. Plik "
"lang\\<code>.po kole DLL mŏ pierszeństwo, na włŏsne poprawki. Zapisz go zachowuje. Bez kosztu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Wszyske skrōty tego menu, jedna linia na akcyjŏ, z klawiszym klawiatury i przycziskym kontrolera. "
"Prawo ôtwiyra lista; wybier akcyjõ Prawym, potym naciś nowy klawisz abo przycisk kiyrownicy. "
"Zapisuje sie richtik w dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje wszysko, co tukej widać, do dlaa.ini (sztelunki a pozycyje panelu / pola fps po "
"przesuniyńciu), zachowujōnc wszyske inksze linie. Zrōb to, jak Ci sie podobo, inaczyj zmiany "
"znikõ przi nastympnym sztarcie. Tryb zapisuje sie sōm."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Przywrŏcŏ kożdy sztelunek tego menu do fabrycznych (model, ôstrzynie, ôstrość tekstur, ôbszar "
"DLAA, ruch, szpigle, profil, panel, pole fps, turbo, foveated, klatki, logowanie), na żywo i w "
"dlaa.ini, zachowujōnc Twoje skrōty i wszyske inksze linie."

